'''Phantom''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Phantom Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Ghost Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The knife is a bright cyan colour with darker cyan patches along it. The blade is surrounded by a grey outside and at the guard there is a cyan gem with two grey swirls around it, The handle is a darker stripy cyan and the tip is bright cyan. The knife's blade is wavy. 

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Spectre]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Spectre Set|Spectre Set]].
*This and its partner gun are the third gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

